sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as User Browser SPA
    participant SupabaseAuth as Supabase Auth Service
    participant DB as PostgreSQL (auth.users)
    participant Edge as Edge Function Gateway

    Note over User,Edge: Target Authentication Protocol (ADR-012)

    User->>SupabaseAuth: POST /auth/v1/token (email, password)
    SupabaseAuth->>DB: Query user by email
    DB-->>SupabaseAuth: Return user record & bcrypt hash
    SupabaseAuth->>SupabaseAuth: Verify bcrypt password hash
    alt Password Valid
        SupabaseAuth->>SupabaseAuth: Issue RS256 JWT (sub=userId, role=authenticated, exp=1h)
        SupabaseAuth->>SupabaseAuth: Generate opaque Refresh Token (auto-rotating)
        SupabaseAuth-->>User: HTTP 200 { access_token, refresh_token, user }
    else Password Invalid / Rate Limit Exceeded
        SupabaseAuth-->>User: HTTP 401 / 429 Error (Progressive Delay)
    end

    Note over User,Edge: Authenticated API Invocation
    User->>Edge: POST /api/v1/analysis/orchestrate (Header: Bearer <access_token>)
    Edge->>Edge: Cryptographically verify JWT signature using Supabase Public Key
    Edge->>Edge: Extract verified auth.uid() claim from JWT payload
    Edge->>Edge: REJECT any client-supplied body.userId parameter
    Edge->>Edge: Proceed with analysis orchestration bound strictly to auth.uid()
